    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Google","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/google"},"datePublished":"2026-07-01T20:26:05.858Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_it-can-be-easy-to-lose-valuable-time-in-your-activity-7478182164325367808-iS5H","text":"It can be easy to lose valuable time in your workday to digital busywork like sorting files, migrating notes and jumping between tabs. ✨ Gemini Spark ✨ is your 24/7 personal AI agent in the Gemini app, designed to take proactive action on your behalf so you can focus on high-value execution.\n\nGive Gemini Spark a task and it works securely in the background to complete multi-step workflows, even if your phone and laptop are turned off.\n\nHere's what's rolling out today to help you cross off your most complex to-dos:\n\n🍎 Automate manual desktop chores: Gemini Spark is now available in the Gemini app for macOS, letting you run tasks like instantly sorting all the PDFs in your Downloads folder, or using the latest invoices saved to your computer to build a budget spreadsheet that updates on a regular schedule.\n\n✅ Turn raw notes into clear tasks: Gemini Spark connects directly with Google Keep and Google Tasks to streamline your daily checklist. This lets you do things like automatically scan your scattered brain-dumps inside Keep and translate them into structured action items.\n\n🔌 Tailor your assistant: Support for custom Model Context Protocol (MCP) gives you the ability to connect your favorite apps directly into Gemini Spark to build a more tailored assistant.\n\n📎 Connect Gemini Spark to your favorite apps: Design custom flyers with Canva, access and share your files with Dropbox, make reservations on OpenTable, order your weekly groceries with Instacart, reserve an apartment tour with Zillow Rentals, and more without you ever having to jump between browser windows.\n\n🗞️ Real-time updates without constantly hitting refresh: Smart schedules allow you to set conditional triggers that run automatically the moment specific parameters are met. You can tell Spark to execute tasks based on live events, like emailing you a match summary the moment a soccer game ends, or automatically serving you a detailed financial report if a stock reaches a specific threshold.\n\nGemini Spark is available in Beta for Google AI Ultra subscribers aged 18+ in the U.S. and this suite of new features is starting to roll out today.\n\nLearn more → goo.gle/4eHGHby","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_it-can-be-easy-to-lose-valuable-time-in-your-activity-7478182164325367808-iS5H"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Google","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/google"},"datePublished":"2026-07-01T19:10:25.843Z","headline":"The latest AI news we announced in June 2026","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_the-latest-ai-news-we-announced-in-june-2026-activity-7478163122114035712-huVd","text":"13+ AI announcements you may have missed from Google in June 👇 \n\nFrom our new Google Home Speaker — built for Gemini — to launching Gemma 4 12B (our latest open model to date), here are our key AI headlines you need to know.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_the-latest-ai-news-we-announced-in-june-2026-activity-7478163122114035712-huVd"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Google","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/google"},"datePublished":"2026-07-01T14:45:11.444Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_monika-a-phd-graduate-and-software-engineer-activity-7478096372332728322-Vj1Z","text":"Monika, a PhD graduate and software engineer in our Bangalore office, shares how she applies her research to build helpful products used by billions. \n\nAre you a researcher looking to take your work from the lab to a global scale? Explore opportunities at Google → https://goo.gle/4bfSivY","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_monika-a-phd-graduate-and-software-engineer-activity-7478096372332728322-Vj1Z"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Google","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/google"},"datePublished":"2026-06-30T17:29:07.220Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_you-can-now-create-60-second-vertical-video-activity-7477775238680702976-n1YH","text":"You can now create 60-second vertical Video Overviews in NotebookLM. 🎬✨\n\nJust upload your notes, textbooks, or links to get a short vertical video breaking down your most complex concepts. It’s powered by Nano Banana 2 Lite — our newest Gemini Image model.\n\nAvailable now for Google AI Pro and Ultra subscribers on mobile and web.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_you-can-now-create-60-second-vertical-video-activity-7477775238680702976-n1YH"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Google","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/google"},"datePublished":"2026-06-30T16:17:06.467Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_today-were-releasing-two-generative-media-activity-7477757116104089600-VMps","text":"Today we're releasing two generative media models that make it easier and more cost-effective for enterprises and developers to build multimedia workflows at scale.\n\nMeet Nano Banana 2 Lite, our fastest and most cost-efficient Gemini Image model, and Gemini Omni Flash, which delivers high-quality video generation and conversational editing. By connecting them with the Interactions API, enterprises and developers can easily build custom multimedia applications and experiences from scratch.\n\nTo show you how these models work together, we built an e-commerce applet in Google AI Studio that turns product shots into cinematic videos. Just upload a photo, and Nano Banana 2 Lite generates brand-accurate images, while Gemini Omni Flash automatically turns the design into a brand new video.\n\nBoth models are available today in Google AI Studio, the Gemini API and the Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform. You can also find Nano Banana 2 Lite rolling out across AI Mode in Search, the Gemini app, and many other products.\n\nLearn more → goo.gle/4vLTIHa","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_today-were-releasing-two-generative-media-activity-7477757116104089600-VMps"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Google","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/google"},"datePublished":"2026-06-29T21:22:25.206Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_as-a-forward-deployed-engineer-fde-on-our-activity-7477471562628100098-Vo5l","text":"As a Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE) on our AI Tech Go-To-Market (GTM) team in Gurgaon, Shivank sits at the crucial intersection of customers and product. His daily mission is to help organizations shape their AI journeys by translating complex, real-world user needs directly into technical product updates. \n\nRecently, he put this into practice by working closely with the CTO and leadership team of one of India's largest companies. \"This was an extremely meaningful and inspiring project as I got an opportunity to positively impact the lives of so many employees of such a large organization,\" Shivank says. \"Collaboration truly drives us at Google and forms the backbone of all our work. It’s actually the environment here that makes everyone so interested in working together.\"\n\nReady to bring your engineering expertise directly to the front lines of client innovation? Explore how you can shape the future of technology and find your next team as a Forward Deployed Engineer →  https://goo.gle/3PUwMWc","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_as-a-forward-deployed-engineer-fde-on-our-activity-7477471562628100098-Vo5l"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Google","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/google"},"datePublished":"2026-06-29T19:40:34.435Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_great-teaching-is-built-on-the-human-connection-activity-7477445932188565505-LwRG","text":"Great teaching is built on the human connection between a teacher and student. As technology evolves, our goal isn't to replace that connection, but to support it.\n\nAt ISTE, we showcased new tools across Google Classroom, Chromebooks and Gemini designed to keep educators at the forefront of AI and providing students with personalized support.\n\nKey updates include:\n- Study notebooks in Gemini that create personalized lessons and quizzes that adapt as a student learns.\n- A new Classroom app in Gemini that helps educators with everyday tasks using their class context.\n\nComing soon: \n- Teacher-led AI activities in Google Classroom that are grounded in a school’s curriculum and give insights into student understanding.\n- No-cost ACT and GRE practice tests developed in partnership with The Princeton Review.\nGuided Learning tools for Chromebooks to help students stay focused.\n\nTo further our commitment, our Google Educator Series is providing free AI training to every educator in the U.S. in partnership with ISTE+ASCD.\n\nLearn more about all of our education updates from ISTE ➡️ https://goo.gle/4xQqdFp","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_great-teaching-is-built-on-the-human-connection-activity-7477445932188565505-LwRG"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Google","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/google"},"datePublished":"2026-06-29T16:06:22.321Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_if-you-read-about-ai-or-are-using-ai-tools-activity-7477392026477412368-2unQ","text":"If you read about AI or are using AI tools, you’ve probably heard the phrase “full-stack.” It’s the driving force that lets us deliver powerful, cost-efficient products to developers and everyday users.\n\nBut what does \"full-stack AI\" actually mean? We asked Richard Seroter, Chief Evangelist at Google Cloud, to break it all down 👇\n\nhttps://goo.gle/4oTMqON ","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_if-you-read-about-ai-or-are-using-ai-tools-activity-7477392026477412368-2unQ"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Google","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/google"},"datePublished":"2026-06-26T19:52:38.899Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_what-makes-a-great-technical-interview-at-activity-7476361807280910337-Us_j","text":"What makes a great technical interview at Google? Don’t just code, explain the choices you make. 💡 Technical recruiter Okwus explains why we care about your problem-solving process — not just the answers.\n\nThinking of applying to an open role? Watch this mock interview to prepare → goo.gle/codinginterview  ","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_what-makes-a-great-technical-interview-at-activity-7476361807280910337-Us_j"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Google","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/google"},"datePublished":"2026-06-26T16:24:48.900Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_heres-whats-new-in-the-gemini-app-this-activity-7476309504213733377-fEOD","text":"Want the latest updates in the Gemini app? Here’s everything we introduced to Gemini this month ⬇️\n\nLearn more about what’s new → gemini.google/gemini-drops","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/google_heres-whats-new-in-the-gemini-app-this-activity-7476309504213733377-fEOD"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Google","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/google","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"1600 Amphitheatre Parkway","addressLocality":"Mountain View","addressRegion":"CA","postalCode":"94043","addressCountry":"US"},"description":"A problem isn't truly solved until it's solved for all. Googlers build products that help create opportunities for everyone, whether down the street or across the globe. Bring your insight, imagination and a healthy disregard for the impossible. Bring everything that makes you unique. Together, we can build for everyone.\n\nCheck out our career opportunities at goo.gle/3DLEokh","numberOfEmployees":{"value":314932,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQGv3cqOuUMY7g/company-logo_200_200/B4EZmhegXHGcAM-/0/1759350753990/google_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Hzaw0d0Yz1Yi-_mDuQ6JQo-Ph41AG50Z8pWjyaeTI0k","description":"Google","@type":"ImageObject"},"sameAs":"https://goo.gle/3DLEokh"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
