  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">It can be easy to lose valuable time in your workday to digital busywork like sorting files, migrating notes and jumping between tabs. ✨ Gemini Spark ✨ is your 24/7 personal AI agent in the Gemini app, designed to take proactive action on your behalf so you can focus on high-value execution.

Give Gemini Spark a task and it works securely in the background to complete multi-step workflows, even if your phone and laptop are turned off.

Here's what's rolling out today to help you cross off your most complex to-dos:

🍎 Automate manual desktop chores: Gemini Spark is now available in the Gemini app for macOS, letting you run tasks like instantly sorting all the PDFs in your Downloads folder, or using the latest invoices saved to your computer to build a budget spreadsheet that updates on a regular schedule.

✅ Turn raw notes into clear tasks: Gemini Spark connects directly with Google Keep and Google Tasks to streamline your daily checklist. This lets you do things like automatically scan your scattered brain-dumps inside Keep and translate them into structured action items.

🔌 Tailor your assistant: Support for custom Model Context Protocol (MCP) gives you the ability to connect your favorite apps directly into Gemini Spark to build a more tailored assistant.

📎 Connect Gemini Spark to your favorite apps: Design custom flyers with <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/canva?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Canva</a>, access and share your files with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/dropbox?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Dropbox</a>, make reservations on <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/opentable?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>OpenTable</a>, order your weekly groceries with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/instacart?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Instacart</a>, reserve an apartment tour with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/zillowrentals/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Zillow Rentals</a>, and more without you ever having to jump between browser windows.

🗞️ Real-time updates without constantly hitting refresh: Smart schedules allow you to set conditional triggers that run automatically the moment specific parameters are met. You can tell Spark to execute tasks based on live events, like emailing you a match summary the moment a soccer game ends, or automatically serving you a detailed financial report if a stock reaches a specific threshold.

Gemini Spark is available in Beta for Google AI Ultra subscribers aged 18+ in the U.S. and this suite of new features is starting to roll out today.

Learn more → <a class="link" href="http://goo.gle/4eHGHby?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>goo.gle/4eHGHby</a></p>
          
            
                  
    

