  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Today we're releasing two generative media models that make it easier and more cost-effective for enterprises and developers to build multimedia workflows at scale.

Meet Nano Banana 2 Lite, our fastest and most cost-efficient Gemini Image model, and Gemini Omni Flash, which delivers high-quality video generation and conversational editing. By connecting them with the Interactions API, enterprises and developers can easily build custom multimedia applications and experiences from scratch.

To show you how these models work together, we built an e-commerce applet in <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/google-ai-studio/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Google AI Studio</a> that turns product shots into cinematic videos. Just upload a photo, and Nano Banana 2 Lite generates brand-accurate images, while Gemini Omni Flash automatically turns the design into a brand new video.

Both models are available today in <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/google-ai-studio/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Google AI Studio</a>, the Gemini API and the Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform. You can also find Nano Banana 2 Lite rolling out across AI Mode in Search, the Gemini app, and many other products.

Learn more → <a class="link" href="http://goo.gle/4vLTIHa?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>goo.gle/4vLTIHa</a></p>
          
            
                  
    

