  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">As a Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE) on our AI Tech Go-To-Market (GTM) team in Gurgaon, Shivank sits at the crucial intersection of customers and product. His daily mission is to help organizations shape their AI journeys by translating complex, real-world user needs directly into technical product updates. 

Recently, he put this into practice by working closely with the CTO and leadership team of one of India's largest companies. "This was an extremely meaningful and inspiring project as I got an opportunity to positively impact the lives of so many employees of such a large organization," Shivank says. "Collaboration truly drives us at Google and forms the backbone of all our work. It’s actually the environment here that makes everyone so interested in working together."

Ready to bring your engineering expertise directly to the front lines of client innovation? Explore how you can shape the future of technology and find your next team as a Forward Deployed Engineer →  <a class="link" href="https://goo.gle/3PUwMWc?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://goo.gle/3PUwMWc</a></p>
<!---->  </div>



        

        
            
      
    
    
    

      <ul class="grid grid-cols-6 grid-rows-[60%_40%] w-main-feed-card-media feed-images-content list-none pl-0
          
          gap-0.125 h-[425px] babybear:h-[360px]" data-test-id="feed-images-content">
